You've never lived until you've been killed by a grid bug.

I have managed to die once from a single grid bug, but more often I end up with  
a cursed scroll of create monster and the grid bug just happens to get in the  
killing blow.  Or when I'm fainting from hunger or paralyzed by a floating eye.

I've always kind of thought that Nethack should take into account those  
circumstances when determining your cause of death, i.e. if you were paralyzed  
and then killed by a grid bug, it should say so!  "killed by a grid bug while  
paralyzed" or "fainting from hunger" or "asleep" or whatever.
